In the afternoon, Rohan comes to my desk.
He says, "Maya, let's go drink coffee."
We go to the office canteen.
I tell Rohan about my Saturday plans.
I say, "This Saturday I will go to Priya's house for dinner."
Rohan asks, "How will you go there?"
I answer, "I think that I will go by metro."
"I think that the metro will be the easiest way."
Rohan says, "Yes, this will be absolutely perfect."
I ask him one more thing.
"I think that I should take a gift for Priya."
"What should I take as a guest?"
Rohan says, "You take a box of traditional Indian sweets."
I ask, "Which sweets should I buy?"
He says, "Take Kaju Katli, it is very delicious."
I like this idea very much.
I say, "Okay, I will buy Kaju Katli."
